    Design --> D5
    Delivery --> D6
    Workers --> D6
    Analytics --> D7
    Automation --> D8
    Billing --> D8
    Forms --> D8
    Integrations --> D8

    Secrets[Secret manager] -.-> IAM
    Secrets -.-> Transport
    OTel[OpenTelemetry collector] -.-> Gateway
    OTel -.-> Workers
    OTel -.-> Delivery
    OTel --> Metrics[Prometheus / Grafana / Loki / tracing]

